        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  HNDRD / NITRIX BULLET 80 — VECTOR ASSEMBLY LOADER V3\n  -----------------------------------------------------\n  Paste as the FIRST Custom Liquid section on the landing page.\n\n  This is not an image-based loader:\n  - The HNDRD mark is built from inline SVG vector pieces.\n  - Every piece physically rises from below and locks into place.\n  - A live 00–100 progress counter confirms that the page is loading.\n  - The black screen wipes upward to reveal the first hero.\n  - Runs on every genuine page visit or browser refresh.\n  - Does not repeat while scrolling or using anchor links.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.classList.add('b80-loading');\n</script>\n\n<style>\n  html.b80-loading,\n  html.b80-loading body {\n    overflow: hidden !important;\n    overscroll-behavior: none;\n  }\n\n  html.b80-loading .b80-villain *,\n  html.b80-loading .b80-villain *::before,\n  html.b80-loading .b80-villain *::after {\n    animation-play-state: paused !important;\n  }\n\n  .b80-loader-v3,\n  .b80-loader-v3 * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .b80-loader-v3 {\n    --orange: #ffa400;\n    --paper: #f3efe5;\n    --black: #030303;\n\n    position: fixed;\n    z-index: 2147483647;\n    inset: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100vh;\n    height: 100svh;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    background: var(--black);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    font-family: Figtree, var(--font-body-family), Arial, sans-serif;\n    cursor: wait;\n    clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0);\n    -webkit-clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0);\n    will-change: clip-path;\n  }\n\n  .b80-loader-v3__topline {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 3;\n    top: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n    left: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n    right: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 52px);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: rgba(243,239,229,.36);\n    font-size: 8px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-heigh